                <note rend="inline" type="source">810.79611 Pan American Airways, Inc./48: Circular
                    telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the American Diplomatic Representatives in Costa Rica,
                            Guatemala, Panama, and Salvador</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-03-07T18:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">March 7, 1928—6
                                p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Pan American Airways flight postponed approximately 30 days.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
